---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
    <section>
        <a class="back" href="/" style="color:#7aa2ff">
            ← Back
        </a>
        <h1>HumanRing</h1>
        <h2>A webring for humans</h2>
        <br />
        <h3>About</h3>
        <p>
            HumanRing is a <strong>TOTALLY SERIOUS</strong> webring made for
            human who have webring.
        </p>
        <p>On this page you will find:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <a href="#requirements">Requirements</a>
            </li>
            <li>
                <a href="#join">How to Join</a>
            </li>
        </ul>
        <br />
        <h3 id="requirements">Requirements:</h3>
        <p>To join the webring:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Be a human(REALLY IMPORTANT)</li>
            <li>You must have a website</li>
            <li>
                Your website must not contain any NSFW or 18+ content, nor
                racist or hateful content
            </li>
            <li>
                Your website should contain the widget before aplying(shown
                below)
            </li>
        </ul>
        <br />
        <h3 id="join">How to Join</h3>
        <p>
            After making sure that you fit the requirements above, you first
            need to add the widget(if you didn't already).
        </p>
        <p>
            You can add the following code and replacing <i>YOUR_URL</i> with
            your site(click to copy):
        </p>
        <pre
            onclick="copycode()"
            style="cursor: pointer;"
        ><code id="widget-code">{`<div style="width: fit-content; border: 2px outset; text-align:center">
  <p style="margin: 0; padding: 0.1em; border: 2px inset">
      This site is a member of humanring.
  </p>
  <div style="display: flex">
      <a
          style="flex: 1; margin: 0; padding: 0.1em; border: 2px inset"
          href="https://webri.ng/webring/humanring/previous?via=YOUR_URL"
      >
          Previous Site
      </a>
      <a
          style="flex: 1; margin: 0; padding: 0.1em; border: 2px inset"
          href="https://webri.ng/webring/humanring/random?via=YOUR_URL"
      >
          Random Site
      </a>
      <a
          style="flex: 1; margin: 0; padding: 0.1em; border: 2px inset"
          href="https://webri.ng/webring/humanring/next?via=YOUR_URL"
      >
          Next Site
      </a>
  </div>
</div>`}</code></pre>
        <br />
        <p>
            Or by making your own widget however you link by using these links
            and replacing <i>YOUR_URL</i> with your site:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>https://webri.ng/webring/humanring/previous?via=YOUR_URL</li>
            <li>https://webri.ng/webring/humanring/next?via=YOUR_URL</li>
            <li>https://webri.ng/webring/humanring/random?via=YOUR_URL</li>
        </ul>
        <br />
        <p>After adding your widget, you can join by one of these ways:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>
                Sending me an email at{" "}
                <a href="mailto:me@crislzy.xyz">me@crislzy.xyz</a> following{" "}
                <a href="/webrings/humanring.txt">this template</a>
            </li>
            <li>
                Completing{" "}
                <a href="https://cris.fillout.com/humanring">this form</a>
            </li>
        </ul>

        <script is:inline>
            async function copycode() {
                const code = document.getElementById("widget-code");
                if (!code) return;

                try {
                    await navigator.clipboard.writeText(code.textContent ?? "");
                    alert("Widget code copied! :D");
                } catch (err) {
                    alert("Couldn't copy the code. Check the console!");
                    console.error(err);
                }
            }
        </script>
        <style>
            #widget-code {
                font-family: monospace;
                font-size: 13px;
                color: var(--green);
            }

            pre:has(#widget-code) {
                background: var(--surface);
                border: 1px solid var(--border);
                border-radius: 8px;
                padding: 12px;
                overflow-x: auto;
                cursor: pointer;
            }

            pre:has(#widget-code):hover {
                border-color: var(--accent);
            }
        </style>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
